# UI Registry

Living catalog of built components. Starts EMPTY on purpose — it reflects what actually exists.

Rule before building ANY UI piece: check if a similar component exists here. If yes, match its exact classes. If no, build it following ui-rules.md + ui-tokens.md, then append it here.

